    <guid isPermaLink="false">6937ee0b3fec3166cf183ec0</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 09 Dec 2025 09:49:52 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>💣Hi！</span></strong><span>这期我们聊了聊“雷点”，主播们有哪些奇特的雷点？雷点背后的形成原因是什么？现代关系中的边界感在哪？娱乐圈大家雷哪些东西？雷点是个体规则还是自我保护机制？...大致聊了这些内容，欢迎你在有空的时间，随意听听看啦~</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期是近期的最后一集节目，我们要停更一段时间啦。</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢过去各位朋友的收听，希望未来有机会再相见❤️</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoIj_M2WvFLWLpFnMtep_KoE_TKf.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>封面图片来源：AI创作</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎙本期主播：科达（主持）、汪開心、死光</span></p><span></span><p><span>🔈嘉宾：老杨</span></p><span></span><p><span>🔔本期你会听到：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="440">07:20</a> 汪開心的雷区：开不合时宜的玩笑&amp;讲黄段子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1056">17:36</a> 亲密关系里隐私被侵犯，怎么咸鱼账号也要来关注？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1265">21:05</a> 跨年陪伴侣or其他？事业VS爱情的生活哲学来了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2601">43:21</a> 腹肌哥一直发腹肌照，雷住了家人们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3086">51:26</a> 踩雷了怎么办？沟通沟通沟通！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>💗感谢收听！希望未来咱们也有缘再相会！</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵开场：</span><a href="https://music.163.com/song?id=2649423776&amp;uct2=U2FsdGVkX199NYhfUQ3aoKLHuulwH7MHWk3cin727/g=" data-url="https://music.163.com/song?id=2649423776&amp;uct2=U2FsdGVkX199NYhfUQ3aoKLHuulwH7MHWk3cin727/g="><span>luther - Kendrick Lamar / SZA</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>🎵结尾：</span><a href="https://music.163.com/song?id=16330798&amp;uct2=U2FsdGVkX1/67McJ4qFGrmYwogpZNwTee5lDVCkOHag=" data-url="https://music.163.com/song?id=16330798&amp;uct2=U2FsdGVkX1/67McJ4qFGrmYwogpZNwTee5lDVCkOHag="><span>Can I Kick It? - A Tribe Called Quest</span></a></p>]]></description>
