  <item>
    <title>从懒惰聊到焦虑：找到目标前，你可以慢点走！【特别篇】</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69130d8221e6d1bd34faea53</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69130d8221e6d1bd34faea53</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 11 Nov 2025 10:20:26 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="56">00:56</a> 正片空降时间🪂</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>⏰Hi！</span></strong><span>这期我们从懒惰聊到能量聊到焦虑！家长、学校、社会和我们眼里的懒惰是什么？懒惰不是原罪，而是焦虑的代名词？我们眼里懒惰的“真相”是什么？从“懒惰”到“焦虑”，如何能平静度过？大致聊了这些内容，欢迎你在有空的时间，随意听听看啦~</span></p><span></span><p><span>听完这期，明天不起床也没关系（真的）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsn7QC8_L9KvPhhYBhJ65S2HOX2u.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>封面图片来源：AI创作</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎙本期主播：科达（主持）、汪開心、死光</span></p><span></span><p><span>🔔本期你会听到：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="131">00:02:11</a> 个人懒惰史分享：从学生时代的“作弊”到被长辈定义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="853">00:14:13</a> 父母的“勤快”与“懒惰” 闲不下来也是自我探索的懒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">00:19:00</a> 高能量骂人？聊聊职场中的“高/低能量”与“懒”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1955">00:32:35</a> 任务过高会摆烂，结果是“懒”，根源是“焦虑”，以及一个番茄工作法分享给大家</span></p><span></span><p><span>💗感谢收听！希望下期咱们也有缘再相会！</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵开场：</span><a href="https://music.163.com/song?id=479382670&amp;uct2=U2FsdGVkX18CHEQVRf6Vdg4IC1TL6n1VU7RfLnWoliw=" data-url="https://music.163.com/song?id=479382670&amp;uct2=U2FsdGVkX18CHEQVRf6Vdg4IC1TL6n1VU7RfLnWoliw="><span>给一个焦虑症的朋友 - 理想后花园</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>🎵结尾：</span><a href="https://music.163.com/song?id=2731077753&amp;uct2=U2FsdGVkX1+JX5nig0BVIB6hJmONLyonWHW/o044yEg=" data-url="https://music.163.com/song?id=2731077753&amp;uct2=U2FsdGVkX1+JX5nig0BVIB6hJmONLyonWHW/o044yEg="><span>你可以慢点走 - SHarK / Rapeter / Kito</span></a></p>]]></description>
