    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🏔Hi！这期我们聊了聊独自一人的生活！独自去做手术是什么体验？单人自驾穿越云贵川有多爽？12岁只身坐火车为何被父母骂？独自做事更好or有他人陪伴更佳？交朋友是带着朋友上路还是在路上找朋友？...大致聊了这些内容，欢迎你在有空的时间，随意听听看啦~</span></p><span></span><p><span>ps：好震惊！我们居然连更了一周！实在是值得一个夸奖！嘿嘿如果觉得这期内容还不错的话：</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>求分享~求分享~求分享~</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq1MVjiNwIuOljn84IsxCJEfxtqE.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>封面图片来源：AI创作</span></p><span></span><p><span>✨本期嘉宾：大头</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎙本期主播：科达（主持）、汪開心、死光</span></p><span></span><p><span>🔔本期你会听到：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="81">00:01:21</a> 🩸巨痛！汪開心得肿瘤独自做手术？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="485">00:08:05</a> 冲~！从拒绝独自看电影到单人自驾穿越云贵川🧐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="722">00:12:02</a> 从贵州到广州，反季节穿搭被父母看见就骂了...</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1052">00:17:32</a> 一个人爬雪山半夜失温！这次真和死神擦肩而过了😲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1883">00:31:23</a> 👁‍🗨原生家庭PTSD，这是我成为独行侠的原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1948">00:32:28</a> 乌蒙山大草原看见俩小孩儿的鞋子：不急先发个朋友圈😁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2103">00:35:03</a> 👶扶弟魔来了？大头弟弟需要哥哥带着跑外卖...</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2642">00:44:02</a> 恋爱中独处陪伴需求差异及散场孤独感探讨💘</span></p><span></span><p><span>00:</span><a href="https://iq.feishu.cn/minutes/obcnkjm36t68r5639vuuo2u4?t=3032000" data-url="https://iq.feishu.cn/minutes/obcnkjm36t68r5639vuuo2u4?t=3032000"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3032">50:32</a></span></a><span> &nbsp;💦带朋友上路or路上找朋友？这是我们的想法</span></p><span></span><p><span>AND SO ON</span></p><span></span><p><span>💗感谢收听！希望下期咱们也有缘再相会！</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵开场：</span><a href="https://music.163.com/song?id=414691487&amp;uct2=U2FsdGVkX1/rjSuxuikLHd0ccPm7YRrgBYwRJDmUQaY=" data-ur